## Functional test checklist

| Test ID | Test | Procedure | Expected result | Actual result / measurement | Pass/Fail | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| T01 | Sensor initialization | Power on and read Serial Monitor | Sensor detected, no init error | | | |
| T02 | Green sample | Measure labelled green tomatoes | Readings logged; class based on calibrated thresholds | | | |
| T03 | Partially ripe sample | Measure labelled partially ripe tomatoes | Readings logged; class based on calibrated thresholds | | | |
| T04 | Red sample | Measure labelled red tomatoes | Readings logged; class based on calibrated thresholds | | | |
| T05 | Start button | Press Start | Conveyor starts | | | |
| T06 | Stop button | Press Stop | Motor command stops | | | |
| T07 | Sorting gate | Command each class with dummy object | Gate reaches intended position | | | |
| T08 | Duplicate detection | Keep object at sensor | One classification until sensor clears | | | |
| T09 | Sensor clear | Remove object | System re-arms after clear interval | | | |
| T10 | Lighting variation | Repeat readings under changed light | Variation documented; thresholds evaluated | | | |
| T11 | Power stability | Observe voltage during motor/servo movement | No reset or unstable behavior | | | |
| T12 | Physical disconnect | Operate the designed drive-power disconnect | Drive power is removed | | | |

